SUMMARY:The Moon occults Alcyone (disappearance only)
DESCRIPTION:Alcyone disappears at 22:18:29 CST\, seen from Shangqiu\, CN.\n
 The Moon sets during the occultation: only the disappearance is above the 
 horizon.\nThe Moon is 4° up in the WNW · dark sky.\nTimes for the Moon's
  mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's edge: https:
 //occult.alokm.com/alcyone-2028-03-30?lat=34.4143&lon=115.6561
